---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | MycoVerse Delivery">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#3E2723] mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Your data protection matters to us.</p>

    <div class="bg-[#FDFBF7] p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#3E2723]/20 space-y-4 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <p>At MycoVerse Delivery, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any information you share with us during checkout and browsing.</p>
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#3E2723] pt-2">Information Usage</h2>
      <p>The details you provide (such as shipping address and contact number) are used exclusively for fulfilling and delivering your orders. We do not sell, trade, or share your personal information with third parties.</p>
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#3E2723] pt-2">Security</h2>
      <p>We implement strict security measures to maintain the safety of your personal data.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>